  "description": "The proposal includes the installation of new illuminated signage incorporating the updated corporate branding -  this comprises 2 fascia signs and a projecting sign. Shopfront frames to be finished in black and installation of internal vinyl window graphics.  Installation of 2 new  ATMs to replace the 2 existing machines, fitted with external protective anti‑graffiti vinyl around them.\nInside the premises, a new 55” digital screen will be installed to replace two older displays that will be removed. \nx4 New penetrations will be required on side elevations facing the alleyway to accommodate x4 new louvres.  \nFor security purposes, a new roller shutter will be introduced. This feature is intended to deter unauthorised access and rough sleeping while maintaining minimal visual impact on the building’s overall façade.",
